    (itch.io): \n\u2022Platformer graphics (Mushroom Land) by Kenney Vleugels (www.kenney.nl)\n\u2022jump
    sound: SFX_Jump_07 by jalastram (Freesound) (pixabay)\n\u2022player death: death2
    by Edimar_Ramide (pixabay)\n\u2022Background music: Exspirare - Dreamy loop by 
    Vrymaa (freesound.org)\n\u2022Enemy noise: Squelching SFX [9] by  SoundDesignForYou:\n\u2022
    Fireflies by EdgeLoopRepeat on itch.io\n\u2022 Waterfall: I recolored this waterfall
