    it purple\n\u2022 Coin is also from class assets\n\u2022 Acid sprite sheet -
    Acid Spell Effect by Pimen (itch.io)\n\u2022 End of level sound - Winner game
    sound by Superpuyof\xE3ns1234 (pixabay)\n\u2022 heart sprite sheet - Health Asset
    Pack by AteBits (itch.io)\n\u2022 boss roar - scylla roar by CHICKENNUGGIE (pixabay)\n\n\n\n\n"
