      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "\u2022 laser gun sound - laser by Sergenious (Freesound) (pixabay)\n\u2022
    font - Turret Roat from Google fonts:\n\u2022 boulder - drew it myself\n\u2022
    poof shroom sound - Poof by ryansitz (Freesound) on pixabay\n\u2022 waterfall
    sound - little waterfall by arin_nehir (Freesound) on pixabay\n\u2022 boss music
    - Cinematic Orchestral Sci-Fi Scene with Distress Signal by GregorQuendel on
    Freesound\n\u2022Boss sprite sheet - Slimy Astronaut Pixel Art Character Pack
    v1.0  by Njuk.Wedang / Godofnjuk (itch.io)\n\u2022 typing sound - Typing Sound
    02 by Soul_Serenity_Sounds (pixabay)\n\u2022 rocket - Rocket pack pixel art by
    BeeMaxStudio (itch.io)\n\u2022 UI elements - 80 Sci-Fi Irregular Frame\n\u2022
    flag - I recolored Waving Triangular Flag by TwiceUponATime (itch.io)\n\u2022
    cute walking enemy mushrooms - Cute Shroom Character Sprite by Cat Creates Games
    (itch.io)\n\u2022 more decorative mushrooms - Pixel Mushroom Collection (16x16)
    by ssugmi (itch.io)\n\u2022 bouncy mushroom tiles - I made these myself, but
    I was inspired by mushroom forest pixel platform asset pack mushrooms by Brysia
    (itch.io)\n"
